        <object id="reference_3" label="跳过、超时与失败降级&#10;项目自研：Recall.rerank / CrossEncoderReranker&#10;通用配置默认 disabled；部署可启用 required/fallback&#10;fallback 仅接受超时或依赖不可用&#10;合约错误仍失败；真实推理结束后才释放并发槽&#10;这些保证不是 CrossEncoder.predict 自动提供的" source="recall/basic/service.py::Recall.rerank; recall/basic/service.py::Recall.rerank; recall/basic/service.py::Recall.rerank; recall/basic/service.py::Recall.rerank">
