        <object id="reference_1" label="历史结果 · 当前授权与有效性&#10;项目自研：Recall.result / Remember.final_guard&#10;重新核验当前权限、版本、生命周期与来源&#10;失效结果拒绝返回；不能把缓存当作当前事实&#10;OWASP 授权原则可作设计依据，不是已接入的库" source="recall/basic/service.py::Recall.result; recall/basic/service.py::Recall.result; remember/basic/service.py::Remember.final_guard; recall/basic/service.py::Recall.result">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#F1F3F6;strokeColor=#7B8797;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=16;fontColor=#273545;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;">
